# --- Pipeline output -------------------------------------------------------
# Everything the skill produces lives here: one directory per song, its
# intermediates (storyboards, reference sheets, keyframes, clips) and the
# finished film, plus .state/ (key-rotation cursor, vision cache).
# It is regenerated on every run and can run to hundreds of megabytes, so it
# is never committed.
out/

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# templates/keys.example.txt is the committed template; any real key file is
# not. Keys pasted into a repo get scraped within minutes.
templates/keys.txt
keys.txt
.keys
